{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34180","headline":"杂讽九首 五 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南有狂兕，猎者西北矢。\n利尘白冥冥，独此清夜止。\n无人语其事，偶坐窥天纪。\n安得东壁明，洪洪用坟史。\n搜扬好古士，一以罄云水。\n流堪洒菁英，风足去稗秕。\n如能出奇计，坐可平贼垒。\n徐陈羲皇道，高驾太平轨。\n攫疏成特雄，濯垢爲具美。\n贡贤当上赏，景福视所履。\n永播南熏音，垂之万年耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}